  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Globalen Malm&#xF6; Museum</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Malm&#xF6; museer f&#xF6;r Globalen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Globalen:    Globalen &#xE4;r en m&#xF6;tesplats f&#xF6;r l&#xE4;rande f&#xF6;r h&#xE5;llbar utveckling, samt lokala och globala fr&#xE5;gor. M&#xF6;tesplatsen &#xE4;r tillg&#xE4;nglig f&#xF6;r alla inv&#xE5;nare i Sk&#xE5;ne, men med fokus p&#xE5; unga. Globalen drivs av Malm&#xF6; Museer, Svenska R&#xF6;da Korset, Individuell M&#xE4;nniskohj&#xE4;lp och R&#xE4;dda Barn</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Globalen&quot; is a venue for learning for sustainable development, and local and global issues. The meeting place is accessible to all residents of Sk&#xE5;ne, but with a focus on youth. &quot;Globalen&quot; is run by Malmo Museum, Swedish Red Cross, IM and Save the Children. Sida collaborate with them and co-finances.</narrative>
  </description>
